name: Guided Setup to Report uses visible controls and zero model capacity
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=@ART/git-config GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM=@ART/git-config
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 MAP | map-plan
keys: Down Down Down Space Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Choose a context JSON path | missing-context
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Enter edits this path | import-options
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EDITING OPTION · threat-model:import | context-path
type: .kuzushi/manual-context.json
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 From: this run | saved-path
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 TASKS FOCUS | returned-tasks
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 saves an inactive revision | configured-context
ask: Can the operator choose manual context through visible Setup controls, see the missing-input blocker and keep model credentials unnecessary for this local Map?
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 30 LAST START FAILED · inspect Start Map details | launch-refused
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 LAST START FAILED | refusal-detail
expect: scope.toml
expect: No worker started
ask: Is the failed launch visible in Setup with a readable cause, explicit recovery and preserved plan selection?
keys: Tab
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repair-policy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 45 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: next
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | guided-scan
expect: Discovery passes
expect: Workers
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | choose-engine
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Space
require-live-snap: 25 [x] secret-scan | selected-native-engine
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Engine choices updated | applied-engine
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | call-limit
type: 0
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | review-limit
type: 0
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | prepared-study
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 ZERO PROVIDER CALLS | approval
expect: Total provider calls: 0
expect: Protected review calls: 0
ask: Does guided Scan inherit the accepted inactive context and offer exactly three local passes with one worker, without silently selecting model discovery or granting model capacity?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: approval-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: approval-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: approval-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: approval-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 ZERO PROVIDER CALLS | approval-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: End y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 2 | findings
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 signal-only | first-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned public example is not an active credential
submit: open F-0002
require-live-snap: 25 signal-only | second-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned public example is not an active credential
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 0 committed / 0 calls | report
expect: 2 reviewed
expect: 6 producer observations
keys: j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the actual guided journey preserve six observations, separate recurrence and two reversible human decisions through export, with no helper-created plan, job or product dispatch?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 15 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-choices
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=@ART/git-config GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM=@ART/git-config
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | recovered-jobs
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 0 committed / 0 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_investigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the approved context, exact finite study, two human decisions and report choices without starting work or requiring model credentials?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
